    "body": "```\r\nvim-patch:8.2.2338: patch 8.2.2338: Vim9: no error if using job_info() result wrongly\r\nvim-patch:9.0.1572: patch 9.0.1572: error messages are not translated\r\nvim-patch:8ffcb47a4 runtime(tutor): fix typo in tutor.nl (#13175)\r\nvim-patch:2bad26fe2 translation(ru): updated Russian translations for tutorials (#13579)\r\nvim-patch:86fcada95 translation(ru): adjust tutor/README.ru.utf-8.txt (#13789)\r\nvim-patch:5528a7293 translation(tr): Improve Turkish documentation (#13800)\r\nvim-patch:aa31346da runtime(tutor): small fixes to the zh tutor (#14081)\r\nvim-patch:ca0e0d270 translation(lt): Added Lithuanian translation of Tutor v. 1.4 by Laurynas Stančikas (#14118)\r\nvim-patch:cb942cc4c translation(lt): Update Lithuanian translation of Vim tutor to v.1.7 (#14176)\r\nvim-patch:9.1.0500: patch 9.1.0500: cannot switch buffer in a popup\r\nvim-patch:7a44f96fe runtime(tutor): Fix wrong spanish translation\r\nvim-patch:c5e24ee24 runtime(doc): add a note for netrw bug reports\r\nvim-patch:eac806bf0 runtime(tutor): Fix missing :s command in spanish translation section 4.4\r\nvim-patch:6fa304f27 runtime(tutor): update the tutor files and re-number the chapters\r\nvim-patch:2e359b98f runtime(tutor): fix typo in Chapter 2\r\nvim-patch:5ccf7f140 runtime(tutor): regenerated some translated tutor1 files\r\nvim-patch:0b5926f77 translation(it): include Italian version of tutor chapter 2\r\nvim-patch:cdbbdb9ec runtime(tutor): fix another typo in tutor2\r\nvim-patch:b183f5028 runtime(tutor): Reformat tutor1\r\nvim-patch:9.1.1058: patch 9.1.1058: translation(sr): Missing Serbian translation for the tutor\r\nvim-patch:397700e50 runtime(new-tutor): update examples from Neovim to Vim\r\nvim-patch:802183082 runtime(tutor): updated Russian translation for tutor chapter 1\r\nvim-patch:5f2a95955 runtime(doc): symlinking netrw.txt causes problems during install on Windows\r\nvim-patch:8322923b4 translation(ru): include Russian translation for chapter two of the tutorial\r\nvim-patch:721be7fd0 runtime(doc): add back help tag \"pi_netrw.txt\"\r\nvim-patch:951d025af runtime(tutor): Add Galician language versions of tutor1 and tutor2\r\nvim-patch:ba19b6589 runtime(doc): fix typo in description of :redrawtabpanel\r\nvim-patch:c2c913242 runtime(new-tutor): update the \"correct\" text in tutor.tutor.json\r\nvim-patch:8d9d2b222 runtime(tutor): Make all tutor files utf-8 only\r\nvim-patch:30dcd0e1f runtime(tutor): apply fixes to runtime/tutor/tutor2\r\nvim-patch:9.1.1494: patch 9.1.1494: runtime(tutor): no French translation for Chapter 2\r\nvim-patch:a0eb40576 runtime(tutor): fix language selection for zh\r\nvim-patch:477c893c0 runtime(tutor): remove duplicate tutor1.zh\r\nvim-patch:b87f133b0 runtime(tutor): Add a section on text objects and special registers to Chapter 2\r\nvim-patch:0ef50d9d8 runtime(tutor): Update German translation for the tutor\r\nvim-patch:9cd512c7f runtime(tutor): Improve Spanish translation of chapter 1\r\nvim-patch:58fafb654 runtime(tutor): Add Spanish translation for chapter 2\r\nvim-patch:48940d94f runtime(tutor): Improve style for chapter 2\r\nvim-patch:bbf616a9d runtime(tutor): Improve Spanish translations\r\nvim-patch:e74e40dc4 runtime(tutor): Improve Spanish translation for chapter 2 after 757b42a\r\nvim-patch:3ac486b8a translation(ru): updated tutor files\r\nvim-patch:a1895b67b runtime(tutor): Add Chinese translation for chapter 1\r\nvim-patch:a4ee22529 translation(sv): Add Swedish translation of tutor2\r\nvim-patch:0eb8e4de4 translation(sv): Update tutor1.sv to version 1.7\r\nvim-patch:542d6ec4f translation(ru): Update Russian translation and fix typos in tutor\r\nvim-patch:89296da39 translation(it): Add Italian translation of tutors README\r\nvim-patch:87f7ef1eb runtime(tutor): Fix grammatical error in Russian tutor\r\nvim-patch:5979d7dd7 PR template duplicates the commit message and needs edits to fill in\r\nvim-patch:9.2.1170: patch 9.2.1170: GTK2 compile error when image feature is enabled\r\nvim-patch:9.2.1172: patch 9.2.1172: Vim9: crash when lambda assigns to item of outer argument\r\nvim-patch:2248250b4 CI: Bump msys2/setup-msys2\r\n```",
